via-hotrod","title":"HotRod","artist":"Carl D’Alvia","date":"2025","medium":"Aluminum and auto paint","url":"https://thealdrich.org/page/sculpture-garden","onView":true,"gallery":"South Lawn","floor":"G"},{"id":"enrique-figueredo-una-enfermedad-que-solamente-el-oro-puede-","title":"Una enfermedad que solamente el oro puede curar (A Sickness Only Gold Can Cure)","artist":"Enrique Figueredo","date":"2026","medium":"Hand carved plywood and acrylic paint mounted on aluminum frame","url":"https://thealdrich.org/page/sculpture-garden","onView":true,"gallery":"Upper Garden","floor":"G"},{"id":"jilaine-jones-archer","title":"Archer","artist":"Jilaine Jones","date":"2021–22","medium":"Concrete, steel, stone","url":"https://thealdrich.org/page/sculpture-garden","onView":true,"gallery":"Upper Garden","floor":"G"},{"id":"jilaine-jones-hay-and-water","title":"Hay and Water","artist":"Jilaine Jones","date":"2020–21","medium":"Steel","url":"https://thealdrich.org/page/sculpture-garden","onView":true,"gallery":"Upper Garden","floor":"G"},{"id":"dan-gunn-the-ungrateful-son-no-6","title":"The Ungrateful Son, No. 6","artist":"Dan Gunn","date":"2018","medium":"Glazed stoneware, marbles, light fixture","url":"https://thealdrich.org/page/sculpture-garden","onView":true,"gallery":"Upper Garden","floor":"G"},{"id":"carl-dalvia-alien","title":"Alien","artist":"Carl D’Alvia","date":"2022","medium":"Aluminum and powder coat","url":"https://thealdrich.org/page/sculpture-garden","onView":true,"gallery":"East Lawn","floor":"G"},{"id":"dan-gunn-ungrateful-son-no-22","title":"Ungrateful Son No. 22 (The Lovers 2)","artist":"Dan Gunn","date":"2026","medium":"Glazed stoneware, glass marbles, and light fixture","url":"https://thealdrich.org/page/sculpture-garden","onView":true,"gallery":"Courtyard","floor":"1"},{"id":"faustin-adeniran-arewa-elegance","title":"Arewa (Elegance)","artist":"Faustin Adeniran","url":"https://thealdrich.org/exhibitions/the-aldrich-decennial-new-art-made-in-connecticut","onVi